        <title>‎Little Ones: Baby Sleep App - App Store</title><!-- HEAD_svelte-h7hqm6_START --><meta name="version" content="2642.2.0-external"><!-- HEAD_svelte-h7hqm6_END --><!-- HEAD_svelte-1frznod_START --><link rel="preconnect" href="//www.apple.com/wss/fonts" crossorigin="anonymous"><link rel="stylesheet" as="style" href="//www.apple.com/wss/fonts?families=SF+Pro,v4%7CSF+Pro+Icons,v1&amp;display=swap" type="text/css" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"><!-- HEAD_svelte-1frznod_END --><!-- HEAD_svelte-c6sxrk_START -->   <meta name="description" content="Download Little Ones: Baby Sleep by Little Ones™ on the App Store. See screenshots, ratings and reviews, user tips, and more apps like Little Ones: Baby Sleep.">  <link rel="canonical" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/little-ones-baby-sleep/id1382444112">        <meta name="apple:title" content="Little Ones: Baby Sleep App - App Store"> <meta name="apple:description" content="Download Little Ones: Baby Sleep by Little Ones™ on the App Store. See screenshots, ratings and reviews, user tips, and more apps like Little Ones: Baby Sleep.">   <meta property="og:title" content="Little Ones: Baby Sleep App - App Store"> <meta property="og:description" content="Download Little Ones: Baby Sleep by Little Ones™ on the App Store. See screenshots, ratings and reviews, user tips, and more apps like Little Ones: Baby Sleep."> <meta property="og:site_name" content="App Store"> <meta property="og:url" content="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/little-ones-baby-sleep/id1382444112"> <meta property="og:image" content="https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/f3/d5/e2/f3d5e2e4-027c-dd1c-d4a6-9e5b27852770/Placeholder.mill/1200x630wa.jpg"> <meta property="og:image:secure_url" content="https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/f3/d5/e2/f3d5e2e4-027c-dd1c-d4a6-9e5b27852770/Placeholder.mill/1200x630wa.jpg"> <meta property="og:image:alt" content="Little Ones: Baby Sleep on the App Store"> <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"> <meta property="og:image:height" content="630"> <meta property="og:image:type" content="image/jpg">  <meta property="og:locale" content="en_US">      <meta name="twitter:title" content="Little Ones: Baby Sleep App - App Store"> <meta name="twitter:description" content="Download Little Ones: Baby Sleep by Little Ones™ on the App Store. See screenshots, ratings and reviews, user tips, and more apps like Little Ones: Baby Sleep."> <meta name="twitter:site" content="@AppStore"> <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/f3/d5/e2/f3d5e2e4-027c-dd1c-d4a6-9e5b27852770/Placeholder.mill/1200x630wa.jpg"> <meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="Little Ones: Baby Sleep on the App Store">    <script id="organization" type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@id":"https://apps.apple.com/#organization","@type":"Organization","name":"App Store","url":"https://apps.apple.com","logo":"https://apps.apple.com/assets/app-store.png","sameAs":["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q368215","https://twitter.com/AppStore","https://www.instagram.com/appstore/","https://www.facebook.com/appstore/"],"parentOrganization":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Apple","@id":"https://www.apple.com/#organization","url":"https://www.apple.com/"}}</script>   <!-- HTML_TAG_START -->
                <script id=software-application type="application/ld+json">
                    {"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareApplication","name":"Little Ones: Baby Sleep","description":"PERSONALIZED BABY SLEEP, MADE SIMPLE\nLittle Ones is a baby sleep app that gives you a personalized daily schedule, adapts when naps change and helps you know what comes next.\n\nA nap runs short, another runs long, or your baby wakes earlier than usual. Our adaptive Sleep-o-Rhythm updates your baby’s day using their age, stage and actual sleep, without you having to calculate wake windows or force a schedule that no longer works.\n\nOpen Little Ones. Know what’s next.\n\nA BABY SLEEP SCHEDULE THAT ADAPTS\nSleep-o-Rhythm gives you a personalized sleep and feeding plan based on your baby’s age and stage.\n\nLog what actually happens and the plan adjusts as your baby’s day unfolds. If a nap is shorter or longer than expected, you can see what to aim for next and keep the rest of the day on track.\n\nNo more trying to calculate wake windows or wondering what one unexpected nap means for the rest of the day.\n\nTRACK SLEEP, NAPS AND FEEDS\nKeep your baby’s sleep and feeding information together in one convenient place.\n\n• Log naps, night sleep and feeds\n• See your baby’s next suggested sleep time\n• Follow a personalized daily rhythm\n• Identify patterns as your baby grows\n• Adapt the day when sleep does not go to plan\n• Understand your baby’s changing sleep needs\n\nHELP WHEN SLEEP GETS TRICKY\nBaby sleep changes constantly, but you do not have to navigate it alone.\n\nFind practical, age-appropriate guidance for:\n• Short naps\n• Frequent night waking\n• Early rising\n• Nap refusal\n• Sleep regressions\n• Settling struggles\n• Bedtime battles\n• Nap transitions\n• Newborn sleep\n• Toddler sleep\n\nWe help you understand what may be happening and what you can do next.\n\nREAL SLEEP EXPERTS, IN YOUR POCKET\nSometimes you need more than an article.\n\nGet personalized support from our certified sleep consultants through private in-app chat. Talk through what is happening with your baby and receive practical guidance tailored to your family’s situation.\n\nA VILLAGE IN YOUR POCKET\nParenting was never meant to happen alone.\n\nInside our Parenting Village, you can connect with other parents, ask questions, share experiences and find support from people navigating the same wonderfully unpredictable stages.\n\nBUILT AROUND YOUR BABY\nLittle Ones combines sleep biology, child development and your baby’s actual day to provide guidance that evolves as they grow.\n\nYou will also find a range of responsive settling and self-settling approaches, allowing you to choose what feels right for your baby and your family. Our focus is not a perfect schedule -it is helping you better understand your baby and feel confident about what comes next.\n\nINDEPENDENTLY ENDORSED\nOur sleep guidance is independently endorsed by Dr Kate Johnson, Ph.D. in Sleep Physiology and postdoctoral fellow in the Department of Sleep Medicine at Harvard Medical School and Stanford Research Institute.\n\n“What I particularly love about the Little Ones strategies is that they can be tailored to your family, so that you really see positive change to your baby’s sleep.”\n\nTRUSTED BY MORE THAN 1 MILLION FAMILIES\nLittle Ones has helped more than one million families around the world navigate baby and toddler sleep.\n\nFrom newborn sleep and changing nap needs to regressions, night waking, early rising, nap transitions and toddler sleep, Little Ones is there as your baby grows.\n\nNo more wondering when the next nap should be, how long your baby should sleep, or what today’s unexpected nap means for the rest of the day.\n\nOpen Little Ones. Know what’s next.\n\nTerms and Conditions: https://www.littleones.co/pages/terms-and-conditions\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.littleones.co/pages/privacy-policy\nEmail: app@littleones.co","image":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/f4/31/85/f4318530-562c-cfc2-8b2c-826f272ccabf/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007epad-0-6-0-85-220.png/1200x630wa.png","availableOnDevice":"iPhone, iPad, iPod","operatingSystem":"Requires iOS 15.0 or later. Compatible with iPhone, iPad, and iPod touch.","offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":0,"priceCurrency":"USD"},"applicationCategory":"LifestyleApplication","aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":3.3,"reviewCount":158,"bestRating":"5","worstRating":"1"},"keywords":["Lifestyle","Education"],"genre":["Lifestyle","Education"],"author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Little Ones™","url":"https://apps.apple.com/us/developer/little-ones/id1382444111"}}
                </script>
