15.08 0 .135.053.162.215l4.676 15.562c.35 1.102 1.048 1.559 2.15 1.532l16.261-.296c.162 0 .216 0 .243.081.027.08-.027.134-.135.215l-13.385 9.246c-.94.645-1.156 1.478-.78 2.527l5.35 15.374c.026.161.053.188 0 .242-.055.08-.135.026-.243-.054l-12.928-9.864c-.86-.672-1.855-.672-2.715 0l-12.928 9.864c-.107.08-.188.134-.242.054"></path></svg> </li><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166m3.87-5.321c-.054-.054-.027-.081 0-.242l5.349-15.374c.376-1.049.161-1.882-.78-2.527L8.613 27.341c-.134-.08-.161-.134-.134-.215s.08-.08.242-.08l16.26.295c1.103.027 1.802-.43 2.151-1.532l4.677-15.562c.027-.162.08-.215.134-.215.08 0 .135.053.162.215l4.676 15.562c.35 1.102 1.048 1.559 2.15 1.532l16.261-.296c.162 0 .216 0 .243.081.027.08-.027.134-.135.215l-13.385 9.246c-.94.645-1.156 1.478-.78 2.527l5.35 15.374c.026.161.053.188 0 .242-.055.08-.135.026-.243-.054l-12.928-9.864c-.86-.672-1.855-.672-2.715 0l-12.928 9.864c-.107.08-.188.134-.242.054"></path></svg> </li> </ol></div></div> <div class="review-header svelte-1b79zq6"><time class="date svelte-1b79zq6" datetime="2020-07-26T23:54:13.000Z">07/26/2020</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><span class="author svelte-1b79zq6">missaprilkat</span></span> </div></div></div> <div class="content svelte-1b79zq6">  <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-1mbzmwz"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-1mbzmwz" style="--lines: 3; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Buying this program was the biggest mistake that I made in my baby’s first year. My baby had a very difficult time syncing with their schedule, and it often turned me into a stressed out mama trying to force sleep on her baby when it was the last thing in the world she wanted. We both ended up in tears several times. In addition I personally found their expert feedback to be somewhat lazy. If you’re having an issue and you’re not on their schedule to the T, they deem your baby as overtired. I can’t tell you how many times I’ve been told that my baby is overtired- how is a baby that gets 10 more minutes of daytime sleep than they recommend overtired? I feel that they’re belief that the schedule is the be all end all prevents their sleep consultants from thinking more critically about what is causing issues- if your baby is not perfectly on the schedule then they assume that’s the problem, and they don’t go much deeper than that. I also was completely unprepared for the 4 month regression when it hit. Had I known you can begin teaching a baby to sleep independently before that, then I could have avoided a lot of that pain. I found the courses and sleep consultants from Taking Cara Babies much more helpful.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div>  <div class="developer-response-container svelte-1b79zq6"><span class="developer-response-heading svelte-1b79zq6">Developer Response</span>   <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-1mbzmwz"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-1mbzmwz" style="--lines: 1; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Hi there, Sorry to hear you are disappointed in the Program, You can email customerservice@littleones.co to discuss your eligibility for a refund.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div> </div></div></div>  <dialog data-testid="dialog" class="svelte-1p01z7" id="" aria-hidden="true"><div data-testid="content-modal" class="content-modal-container svelte-1ih6d3u" dir="auto"><div class="button-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><button data-testid="content-modal-close-button" class="close-button svelte-1ih6d3u" type="button" aria-label="Close"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 18 18" data-testid="content-modal-close-button-svg"><path d="M1.2 18C.6 18 0 17.5 0 16.8c0-.4.1-.6.4-.8l7-7-7-7c-.3-.2-.4-.5-.4-.8C0 .5.6 0 1.2 0c.3 0 .6.1.8.3l7 7 7-7c.2-.2.5-.3.8-.3.6 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2 0 .3-.1.6-.4.8l-7 7 7 7c.2.2.4.5.4.8 0 .7-.6 1.2-1.2 1.2-.3 0-.6-.1-.8-.3l-7-7-7 7c-.2.1-.5.3-.8.3"></path></svg></button> </div> <div class="header-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><h1 data-testid="content-modal-title" class="title svelte-1ih6d3u">Save yourself the heartache</h1> </div> <div class="content-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><div class="container svelte-1b79zq6 is-detail-view" aria-labelledby="review-6245646719-title" dir="ltr"><div class="header svelte-1b79zq6"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1b79zq6"> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:24px;"><ol class="stars svelte-1fdd9o7" aria-label="1 Star"><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166"></path></svg> </li><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2