ass="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166m3.87-5.321c-.054-.054-.027-.081 0-.242l5.349-15.374c.376-1.049.161-1.882-.78-2.527L8.613 27.341c-.134-.08-.161-.134-.134-.215s.08-.08.242-.08l16.26.295c1.103.027 1.802-.43 2.151-1.532l4.677-15.562c.027-.162.08-.215.134-.215.08 0 .135.053.162.215l4.676 15.562c.35 1.102 1.048 1.559 2.15 1.532l16.261-.296c.162 0 .216 0 .243.081.027.08-.027.134-.135.215l-13.385 9.246c-.94.645-1.156 1.478-.78 2.527l5.35 15.374c.026.161.053.188 0 .242-.055.08-.135.026-.243-.054l-12.928-9.864c-.86-.672-1.855-.672-2.715 0l-12.928 9.864c-.107.08-.188.134-.242.054"></path></svg> </li><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166m3.87-5.321c-.054-.054-.027-.081 0-.242l5.349-15.374c.376-1.049.161-1.882-.78-2.527L8.613 27.341c-.134-.08-.161-.134-.134-.215s.08-.08.242-.08l16.26.295c1.103.027 1.802-.43 2.151-1.532l4.677-15.562c.027-.162.08-.215.134-.215.08 0 .135.053.162.215l4.676 15.562c.35 1.102 1.048 1.559 2.15 1.532l16.261-.296c.162 0 .216 0 .243.081.027.08-.027.134-.135.215l-13.385 9.246c-.94.645-1.156 1.478-.78 2.527l5.35 15.374c.026.161.053.188 0 .242-.055.08-.135.026-.243-.054l-12.928-9.864c-.86-.672-1.855-.672-2.715 0l-12.928 9.864c-.107.08-.188.134-.242.054"></path></svg> </li> </ol></div></div> <div class="review-header svelte-1b79zq6"><time class="date svelte-1b79zq6" datetime="2020-07-26T23:54:13.000Z">07/26/2020</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><span class="author svelte-1b79zq6">missaprilkat</span></span> </div></div></div> <p><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Buying this program was the biggest mistake that I made in my baby’s first year. My baby had a very difficult time syncing with their schedule, and it often turned me into a stressed out mama trying to force sleep on her baby when it was the last thing in the world she wanted. We both ended up in tears several times. In addition I personally found their expert feedback to be somewhat lazy. If you’re having an issue and you’re not on their schedule to the T, they deem your baby as overtired. I can’t tell you how many times I’ve been told that my baby is overtired- how is a baby that gets 10 more minutes of daytime sleep than they recommend overtired? I feel that they’re belief that the schedule is the be all end all prevents their sleep consultants from thinking more critically about what is causing issues- if your baby is not perfectly on the schedule then they assume that’s the problem, and they don’t go much deeper than that. I also was completely unprepared for the 4 month regression when it hit. Had I known you can begin teaching a baby to sleep independently before that, then I could have avoided a lot of that pain. I found the courses and sleep consultants from Taking Cara Babies much more helpful.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> <div class="developer-response-container svelte-1b79zq6"><div class="developer-response-header svelte-1b79zq6"><span class="developer-response-heading svelte-1b79zq6">Developer Response</span> <time class="date svelte-1b79zq6" datetime="2020-09-27T23:14:06.000Z">09/27/2020</time></div> <!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Hi there, Sorry to hear you are disappointed in the Program, You can email customerservice@littleones.co to discuss your eligibility for a refund.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div></p></div> </div> </div> </dialog> </div></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-3" data-index="3" aria-hidden="true"><div class="svelte-13b6ljx"><div class="container svelte-1b79zq6" aria-labelledby="review-8013291066-title" dir="ltr"><div class="header svelte-1b79zq6"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1b79zq6"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><h3 id="review-8013291066-title" class="title svelte-1b79zq6">Miracle program!</h3></span> </div> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:12px;"><ol class="stars svelte-1fdd9o7" aria-label="5 Stars"><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166"></path></svg> </li><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166"></path></svg> </li><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166"></path></svg> </li><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166"></path></svg> </li><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.5.565 4.166-.645l14.218-10.455L46.19 59.406c1.666 1.21 3.037 1.505 4.166.645 1.102-.833 1.344-2.204.672-4.166l-5.618-16.718 14.353-10.32c1.666-1.183 2.338-2.42 1.908-3.764-.43-1.29-1.693-1.935-3.763-1.908l-17.605.108-5.348-16.8C34.308 4.496 33.34 3.5 31.944 3.5c-1.372 0-2.34.995-2.984 2.984L23.61 23.283l-17.605-.108c-2.07-.027-3.333.618-3.763 1.908-.457 1.344.242 2.58 1.909 3.763l14.352 10.321-5.617 16.718c-.672 1.962-.43 3.333.672 4.166"></path></svg> </li> </ol></div></div> <div class="review-header svelte-1b79zq6"><time class="date svelte-1b79zq6" datetime="2021-11-11T19:04:43.000Z">11/11/2021</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353"><span class="author svelte-1b79zq6">Jenjenchik</span></span> </div></div></div> <div class="content svelte-1b79zq6">  <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-1mbzmwz"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-1mbzmwz" style="--lines: 3; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->I was at my wit's end with my 4 month old all of a a sudden not sleeping more than an hour at a time for 3 weeks. I read and tried two popular books - Babywise and Healthy Sleep Habits, Happy Child but they did not help one bit. I found this program with Google's help and it is a lifesaver. It was hard at first, and my baby's sleep did get worse, but I stuck with it as the program said to and here I am on day 8 of the program and my baby is sleeping almost exactly to the schedule of the program. I feel like a new woman now that we are all getting sleep. We still have more work to do to get him more on track, but I have seen such an improvement that I'm so thankful for this program. Reasons I love it:1. It's 100% geared toward the weeks of age my baby is and his developmental needs2. It sends you notifications on your phone when it's time to feed your baby milk or solids, when it's time to start getting them ready for their nap or bedtime, when it's time to wake them up, etc. 3. They have a daily schedule to follow for your baby and also a troubleshooting schedule to follow with tips on what to do to get your baby back on track if they don't sleep well or miss feedings, etc. 4. Tons of quick read educational materials to better learn why your baby is having trouble sleeping, how to reach self-settling and moreJust a great program and so worth the price. Getting a good night sleep is priceless to me.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div>  <div class="developer-response-container svelte-1b79zq6"><span class="developer-response-heading svelte-1b79zq6">Developer Response</span>   <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-1mbzmwz"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-1mbzmwz" style="--lines: 1; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Thank you so much for your lovely review! We would love to use this as a testimonial on our social channels. If that's ok with you can you please email customerservice@littleones.coThanks :)<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div> </div></div></div>  <dialog data-testid="dialog" class="svelte-1p01z7" id="" aria-hidden="true"><div data-testid="content-modal" class="content-modal-container svelte-1ih6d3u" dir="auto"><div class="button-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><button data-testid="content-modal-close-button" class="close-button svelte-1ih6d3u" type="button" aria-label="Close"><svg width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 18 18" data-testid="content-modal-close-button-svg"><path d="M1.2 18C.6 18 0 17.5 0 16.8c0-.4.1-.6.4-.8l7-7-7-7c-.3-.2-.4-.5-.4-.8C0 .5.6 0 1.2 0c.3 0 .6.1.8.3l7 7 7-7c.2-.2.5-.3.8-.3.6 0 1.2.5 1.2 1.2 0 .3-.1.6-.4.8l-7 7 7 7c.2.2.4.5.4.8 0 .7-.6 1.2-1.2 1.2-.3 0-.6-.1-.8-.3l-7-7-7 7c-.2.1-.5.3-.8.3"></path></svg></button> </div> <div class="header-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><h1 data-testid="content-modal-title" class="title svelte-1ih6d3u">Miracle program!</h1> </div> <div class="content-container svelte-1ih6d3u"><div class="container svelte-1b79zq6 is-detail-view" aria-labelledby="review-8013291066-title" dir="ltr"><div class="header svelte-1b79zq6"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1b79zq6"> <div style="display: contents; --fill-color:var(--systemOrange); --star-size:24px;"><ol class="stars svelte-1fdd9o7" aria-label="5 Stars"><li class="star svelte-1fdd9o7"><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64"><path d="M13.559 60.051c1.102.86 2.