to feed your baby milk or solids, when it's time to start getting them ready for their nap or bedtime, when it's time to wake them up, etc. 3. They have a daily schedule to follow for your baby and also a troubleshooting schedule to follow with tips on what to do to get your baby back on track if they don't sleep well or miss feedings, etc. 4. Tons of quick read educational materials to better learn why your baby is having trouble sleeping, how to reach self-settling and moreJust a great program and so worth the price. Getting a good night sleep is priceless to me.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> <div class="developer-response-container svelte-1b79zq6"><div class="developer-response-header svelte-1b79zq6"><span class="developer-response-heading svelte-1b79zq6">Developer Response</span> <time class="date svelte-1b79zq6" datetime="2021-11-15T20:28:25.000Z">11/15/2021</time></div> <!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Thank you so much for your lovely review! We would love to use this as a testimonial on our social channels. If that's ok with you can you please email customerservice@littleones.coThanks :)<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div></p></div> </div> </div> </dialog> </div></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx placeholder" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-4" data-index="4" aria-hidden="true"></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx placeholder" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-5" data-index="5" aria-hidden="true"></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx placeholder" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-6" data-index="6" aria-hidden="true"></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-13b6ljx placeholder" data-test-id="shelf-grid-list-item-7" data-index="7" aria-hidden="true"></li> </ul> <button aria-label="Next Page" type="button" class="shelf-grid-nav__arrow shelf-grid-nav__arrow--right svelte-133ytgj" data-testid="shelf-button-right" style="--offset: 0px;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 9 31"><path d="M5.275 29.46a1.61 1.