te chat with our sleep consultants — get personalized sleep advice in a secure, private conversation within the LittleOnes app. This feature will be gradually enabled among all premium users over next couple weeks. This release also includes minor bug fixes and stability improvements.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> </span></p> <div class="metadata svelte-1t5dyc5"><span class="svelte-1t5dyc5">7.5.0</span> <time datetime="2025-09-24" class="svelte-1t5dyc5">09/24/2025</time></div></div> </div> </li><li><div class="container detail  svelte-1t5dyc5"><div class="inner svelte-1t5dyc5"><p class="svelte-1t5dyc5">  <span class="svelte-epwvmp"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Minor bug fixes and stability improvements.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> </span></p> <div class="metadata svelte-1t5dyc5"><span class="svelte-1t5dyc5">7.4.11</span> <time datetime="2025-09-03" class="svelte-1t5dyc5">09/03/2025</time></div></div> </div> </li></ul></div> </div> </dialog></div> <div class="container  overview svelte-1t5dyc5" aria-labelledby="mostRecentVersion"><div class="inner svelte-1t5dyc5"><p class="svelte-1t5dyc5"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1r39353" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 5);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1r39353">  <span class="svelte-epwvmp"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Minor bug fixes and improvements.<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> </span></span> </div> <button class="svelte-1t5dyc5">more</button></p> <div class="metadata svelte-1t5dyc5"><span class="svelte-1t5dyc5">Version 8.1.10</span> <time datetime="2026-10-13" class="svelte-1t5dyc5">Oct 13</time></div></div> </div> </section> <section id="privacyHeader" data-test-id="shelf-wrapper" aria-label="App Privacy" class="shelf svelte-1svznay    padding-top"><div slot="title" class="title-container svelte-1n919rh"><button>  <div class="title-action-wrapper svelte-1oivr99">  <a aria-label="App Privacy" href="#" data-test-id="internal-link" class="svelte-jrkm1h"><div class="link-contents svelte-1oivr99"><h2 class="shelf