38:25 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Minor bug fixes and improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.7.0","secondarySubtitle":"Fri Apr 24 2026 20:09:04 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Minor bug fixes and improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.6.9","secondarySubtitle":"Thu Apr 16 2026 05:59:09 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Minor bug fixes and improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.6.8","secondarySubtitle":"Mon Mar 02 2026 19:36:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Minor bug fixes and improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.6.7","secondarySubtitle":"Thu Feb 26 2026 19:38:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Minor bug fixes and improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.6.6","secondarySubtitle":"Mon Feb 16 2026 17:37:01 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Minor bug fixes and improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.6.5","secondarySubtitle":"Tue Feb 03 2026 18:05:16 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Minor bug fixes and improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.6.4","secondarySubtitle":"Mon Dec 15 2025 22:32:30 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Minor bug fixes and improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.6.3","secondarySubtitle":"Wed Dec 10 2025 17:23:05 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Minor bug fixes and improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.6.2","secondarySubtitle":"Wed Dec 03 2025 10:37:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Private chat has been upgraded so each little one gets their own chat. This will help users with multiple little ones keep conversations separate. We've also included minor bug fixes and improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.6.1","secondarySubtitle":"Fri Nov 28 2025 11:45:30 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Introducing the new Village - a refreshed community space where our team shares expert sleep advice, helpful tips, and updates. 1:1 sleep consultant support is now moving to Private Chat for a more personalized and private experience. This release also includes bug fixes and performance improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.6.0","secondarySubtitle":"Wed Nov 19 2025 19:47:39 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Minor bug fixes and stability improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.5.4","secondarySubtitle":"Thu Nov 13 2025 20:43:34 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Minor bug fixes and stability improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.5.3","secondarySubtitle":"Tue Oct 21 2025 08:53:40 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Minor bug fixes and stability improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.5.2","secondarySubtitle":"Fri Oct 10 2025 04:10:48 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"Minor bug fixes and stability improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"7.5.1","secondarySubtitle":"Wed Oct 01 2025 13:42:31 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"$kind":"TitledParagraph","text":"We are ex